## Common errors

| Error | duck-auth code | Cause |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `AADSTS50011` | `AUTH/PROVIDER_FAILED` | Redirect URI mismatch. |
| `AADSTS70008` | `AUTH/PROVIDER_FAILED` | Auth code expired. |
